WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
Even if I was wrong before

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:02,920
But I can't support you

3
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,520
You guys have already turned into a mess.

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,520
How could you betray me

5
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,580
If there is no lighter

6
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:11,780
Who do you think you are, Sister Weiwei?

7
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,220
That time I rummaged through my bag before

8
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:14,340
I take the blame

9
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:15,580
I also lost the rice.

10
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:17,940
I won’t take the blame this time.

11
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,580
I dug wild vegetables on the north slope for ten days

12
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:23,620
Is it fair to eat half a meal every day?

13
00:00:24,210 --> 00:00:25,610
Chen Yao’s undercover allocation

14
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,620
I applaud with both hands

15
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:31,420
Can people who work a lot eat enough?

16
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:35,820
You are all traditional

17
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:37,180
Join me together

18
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:38,900
The human heart is your own fault

19
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:43,460
You just turned a blind eye, Sister Weiwei, don’t blame me

20
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:45,620
People have to eat

21
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:47,370
I have filmed too many scenes

22
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:49,730
I’ve seen too many crews fall apart.

23
00:00:49,970 --> 00:00:51,010
biggest reason

24
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:53,380
It's just uneven distribution of the spoils.

25
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:54,980
uneven division of labor

26
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:57,100
This problem is not solved

27
00:00:57,820 --> 00:01:00,410
We'll just drag you to death

28
00:01:00,410 --> 00:01:01,690
Since it makes no sense to everyone

29
00:01:02,050 --> 00:01:04,130
Start fishing for distribution today

30
00:01:04,130 --> 00:01:05,050
Same thing

31
00:01:05,050 --> 00:01:06,050
who makes sense
